WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.549 --> 00:00:05.549
Where I come from

00:00:05.549 --> 00:00:08.149
civil war and politics affects each family

00:00:08.149 --> 00:00:09.590
in one way or another.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.910
I’m no exception:

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.549
My father was assassinated when I was 5 years
old.

00:00:14.549 --> 00:00:17.570
Since then I learned how to seek the truth,

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:20.269
to find it, to face it and tell it

00:00:20.269 --> 00:00:22.900
no matter how difficult and unpopular.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.759
And exactly this search brought me to journalism.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.839
Now, in the Middle East, political actors

00:00:27.839 --> 00:00:31.000
can be extremely influential in the media
business.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.950
They use them to voice and defend their own
interests.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.690
So you can imagine how difficult it is for a journalist

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:39.830
to be independent in such an environment.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:42.360
My aim is to pursue the truth

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.570
by accurately verifying facts,

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.920
challenging common assumptions

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:49.330
and presenting the fullest version of the
truth

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:51.220
that I can deliver.

